<title>UK: Zurich sets 250 million Swiss franc 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Zurich sets 250 million Swiss franc 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ZURICH, CANTON OF</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    04.NOV.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.35    PAY DATE    04.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   DENOMS (K) 5	   EOS	   18.OCT.96</p>
